    back chevron sits right next to it), so it looked visibly off —
    thinner/smaller and not vertically centered in its 32px circle. Built
    here in the same stroke style as the rest of this file (rather than
    inlining the Figma export's filled/masked close_small path) so it
    matches its sibling icons exactly and inherits color via currentColor
    like they do. Sized to span most of the 24px box (5-19, not 6-18) so
    it reads with the same visual weight as the chevron icons next to it.
  {%- endcomment -%}

